### U.S. EXPORT ADMINISTRATION REGULATIONS (EAR) COMPLIANCE
This software utilizes standard, publicly available cryptographic algorithms (Ed25519, SPAKE2, ChaCha20-Poly1305). Under U.S. Export Administration Regulations (15 CFR § 742.15(b)), publicly available open-source software implementing standard mass-market encryption is eligible for export without specific individual licenses.

